{"id":"149340ab585b16c7","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-ACA0-conservative-over-PA.md","title":"ACA0 Is Conservative over PA for First Order Sentences","display":"thm-ACA0-conservative-over-PA — ACA0 Is Conservative over PA for First Order Sentences","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-ACA0-conservative-over-PA","aliases":["62-thm-ACA0-conservative-over-PA"],"display":"thm-ACA0-conservative-over-PA — ACA0 Is Conservative over PA for First Order Sentences","depends_on":["[[62-df-ACA0]]","[[62-df-first-order-arithmetic]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","[[62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem IX.1.5; Corollary IX.1.6; Remark IX.1.7","source_pages":[362],"source_pdf_pages":[380]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-ACA0-conservative-over-PA"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-ACA0-conservative-over-PA</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ACA0-conservative-over-PA — ACA0 Is Conservative over PA for First Order Sentences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f9bb628fd6df6ce\" href=\"?note=0f9bb628fd6df6ce\" title=\"62-df-first-order-arithmetic\">62-df-first-order-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"572865a260265c12\" href=\"?note=572865a260265c12\" title=\"62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction\">62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem IX.1.5; Corollary IX.1.6; Remark IX.1.7"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>362</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>380</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f9bb628fd6df6ce\" href=\"?note=0f9bb628fd6df6ce\" title=\"62-df-first-order-arithmetic\">62-df-first-order-arithmetic</a>；Conservative 与 Cn 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>；PA 归纳实例的可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"572865a260265c12\" href=\"?note=572865a260265c12\" title=\"62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction\">62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}over\\text{-}PA}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}over\\text{-}PA}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0)=\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0)=\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>IX.1.5：任意 PA 的一阶模型 M，把集合域扩充为 M 上带数参数的一阶可定义集 Def(M)，即得到 ACA₀ 模型。算术公式中的这些集合参数可用其定义替换，故理解和集合归纳都成立。若 PA 不证一阶句子 φ，完备性给 PA+¬φ 模型，按此扩充仍保留 ¬φ；健全性排除 ACA₀ 证明 φ。反向由 ACA₀ 的算术归纳包含 PA 的所有公理。比较的是演绎闭包，不要求两份公理表字面包含。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem IX.1.5; Corollary IX.1.6; Remark IX.1.7；纸面页 362；PDF 页 380。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-first-order-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0f9bb628fd6df6ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-first-order-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction","status":"resolved","id":"572865a260265c12","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-